    "text": "By Bill Snyder ,\n2 hours ago BILOXI, Miss. (WLOX) — More than 300 of Mississippi’s chiefs of police and law enforcement administrators gathered on the Coast this week for the annual Mississippi Association of Chiefs of Police conference. Long Beach Police Chief Billy Seal, this year’s president of the association, said the conference focuses... Read full article",
